Build artifacts and packaging scripts.

Phase 1 will add:
  build_mlib.do      - compiles ../mata/*.mata into lspmixw.mlib
  package.do         - assembles spmixw.pkg + stata.toc for `net install`
  lspmixw.mlib       - generated; gitignored
  spmixw.pkg         - generated; gitignored
  stata.toc          - generated; gitignored
